*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0012
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-08-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 229
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0012.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> CLAIM TYPE A=AUTO H=HOME M=MEDICAL
    05 LOSS-TYPE          PIC X.
    *> CLAIMED AMOUNT
    05 CLM-AMOUNT         PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 DEDUCTIBLE-AMT     PIC 9(5)V99.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 PAYOUT-AMT         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
    *> A=APPROVE I=INVESTIGATE D=DENY
    05 CLAIM-DECN         PIC X VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 4000-SETTLE-CLAIM
    DISPLAY "PAYOUT-AMT=" PAYOUT-AMT
    DISPLAY "CLAIM-DECN=" CLAIM-DECN
    STOP RUN.
4000-SETTLE-CLAIM.
    *> MEDICAL CO-INSURANCE
    IF LOSS-TYPE = 'M'
        COMPUTE PAYOUT-AMT = CLM-AMOUNT * 0.90
    ELSE IF CLM-AMOUNT > 0.00
        COMPUTE PAYOUT-AMT = CLM-AMOUNT - DEDUCTIBLE-AMT
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO PAYOUT-AMT
        MOVE 'D' TO CLAIM-DECN
    END-IF
    END-IF.
